			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1772385096858,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Growth is AMORTIZED O(1) — individual appends can be O(n) (on growth), but averaged over many appends = O(1)\nPro move: pre-allocate if you know the size:  s := make([]int, 0, 1000)  — zero reallocations!",
			"fontSize": 13,
			"fontFamily": 3,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Growth is AMORTIZED O(1) — individual appends can be O(n) (on growth), but averaged over many appends = O(1)\nPro move: pre-allocate if you know the size:  s := make([]int, 0, 1000)  — zero reallocations!",
